WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:31.376
Eddy drove into the car wash.

2
00:00:31.377 --> 00:00:35.292
Hiss! Wump! Wump! Wump!

3
00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:40.503
The building was noisy.

4
00:00:40.504 --> 00:00:46.713
Water splashed on Eddy.

5
00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:52.537
"Whoa!" he said.

6
00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:56.962
Bubbles were everywhere.

7
00:00:56.963 --> 00:01:00.589
Big brushes spun.

8
00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:03.407
They cleaned his sides.

9
00:01:03.408 --> 00:01:09.211
The brushes cleaned Eddy's top.

10
00:01:09.212 --> 00:01:12.297
They cleaned his tires.

11
00:01:12.298 --> 00:01:15.057
Eddy laughed.

12
00:01:15.058 --> 00:01:17.218
"That tickles!"

13
00:01:17.219 --> 00:01:19.917
More water sprayed.

14
00:01:19.918 --> 00:01:25.799
Suds dripped off Eddy.

15
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:38.378
Eddy came out of the car wash.

16
00:01:38.379 --> 00:01:44.381
"That was fun!" he said.

17
00:01:44.382 --> 00:01:47.895
"Who will go next?" Mr. Grill asked.

18
00:01:47.896 --> 00:02:00.045
"Me!" the students shouted.

19
00:02:00.046 --> 00:02:03.049
Everyone got clean.

20
00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:05.615
Even Jeb sparkled.

21
00:02:05.616 --> 00:02:12.786
"I love the car wash!" he said.

22
00:02:12.787 --> 00:02:16.209
Finally it was Poppy's turn.

23
00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:18.656
Poppy frowned.

24
00:02:18.657 --> 00:02:24.786
"I am not going in there!"
